  <h1 class="site-home-h2" style="font-size:2rem">Proof the report came from a real conversation.</h1>
  <p class="site-words">Every Record keeps the conversation it was made from: your texts, your photos, your voice notes and Quickler&#x27;s replies, laid out as a chat.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Voice notes can be played back, with the written-out words beneath them.</p>
  <p class="site-words">You can search the conversation for a word and jump to each message that holds it.</p>
  <p class="site-words">If the person used Telegram, the transcript says so. If they used both, it says that.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Messages are kept while the Record is in use and deleted three years after the last activity, or sooner if you delete them.</p>
